==German==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|goh|de}} ''[[ostan]]'', related to the Indo-European root ''*ausos'' "dawn", compare {{etyl|la|-}} ''[[aurora]]'', and {{etyl|la|-}} ''[[auster]]'', which, probably due to a re-orientation, means "South".

