* {{IPA|/ˈɔstən/|/ˈɔstn̩/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Osten.ogg|Audio (Germany)}}
* {{audio|De-at-Osten.ogg|Audio (Austria)}}
*: {{rhymes|ɔstən|ɔstn̩|lang=de}}

